 "remarks": "The Ultimate Canvas on the Cul-de-Sac: Build Your Vision in the Village Corridor! Tucked away on one of the neighborhood's most coveted, postcard-worthy cul-de-sacs, this rare 0.32-acre land opportunity serves up the ultimate blend of peaceful seclusion and unbeatable village convenience-complete with sidewalks leading right to the heart of town. Perched on a flat, dry, and sun-drenched south-facing parcel, the site provides an optimal level footprint with all-day natural light, ready for you to bring your dream team and build a custom masterpiece from the ground up. Set among a gorgeous tapestry of mature greenery and impressive multi-million-dollar new construction, you are investing in a premier street where location is king, upside is limitlessly bright, and top-rated New Canaan schools and the train are just minutes away.",
